"The critical points lie on the circle ${u}^{2}+{v}^{2}=1.$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324114 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534975 true] [17592186324114 1111 #uuid "66cd5471-a3a9-5b0f-bd01-a85a8ddea804" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324115 1034 "The critical points lie on the hyperbola ${u}^{2}-{v}^{2}=1.$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324115 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534975 true] [17592186324115 1111 #uuid "052efdc3-ad52-5311-be2c-b97b25e083a3" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324116 1017 #edb/ref 17592186324117 13194139534975 true] [17592186324116 1089 "q-81274" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324116 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139534975 true] [17592186324116 1100 "Find the locations of all of the critical points of $T,$ where $T$ is defined as\n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]⟶[\\begin{aligned}{e}^{uv} \\\\ u+2v\\end{aligned}].\n$$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324116 1113 #uuid "08b26d40-c5f1-558a-a1d7-4ddf15b255a6" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324116 1145 "Given a transformation \n\n$$\nT:[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]\\to [\\begin{aligned}x(u,v) \\\\ y(u,v)\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nthe Jacobian determinant of $T,$ denoted $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)},$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo find the locations of the critical points of $T,$ we need to solve \n\n$$\n\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.\n$$\n\nHere, we have $x(u,v)={e}^{uv}$ and $y(u,v)=u+2v.$\n\nFirst, we find the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & =v{e}^{uv} & \\,\\frac{∂x}{∂v} & =u{e}^{uv} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & =1 & \\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v} & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the corresponding Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}v{e}^{uv} & u{e}^{uv} \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =v{e}^{uv}\\cdot 2-u{e}^{uv}\\cdot 1 \\\\  & ={e}^{uv}(2v-u).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThe function has critical points when $\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}=0.$ So, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =0 \\\\ {e}^{uv}(2v-u) & =0 \\\\ 2v-u & =0 \\\\ u & =2v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n  \n\nThe equation $u=2v$ defines a line in the $uv$-plane." 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324118 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324119 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324120 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324121 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324122 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1041 "selection" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1104 #edb/ref 17592186324121 13194139534975 true] [17592186324117 1110 #uuid "4030c9c3-32ab-5c33-9366-129b0d91d1e6" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324118 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $u=-2v.$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324118 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534975 true] [17592186324118 1111 #uuid "557ad530-b79f-5d43-9d3b-3beaa66d4fce" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324119 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $v=-2u.$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324119 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534975 true] [17592186324119 1111 #uuid "c9a795de-9ba5-5977-8acf-f0c059ac74ef" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324120 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $v=2u.$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324120 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534975 true] [17592186324120 1111 #uuid "2d554aa2-a151-5249-9902-b06b8467a6f0" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324121 1034 "The critical points lie on the line $u=2v.$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324121 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534975 true] [17592186324121 1111 #uuid "b623dfb1-f71e-588f-b887-aec5ef8b7d72" 13194139534975 true] [17