\frac{∂v}{∂x} & \\frac{∂v}{∂y}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we take the reciprocal:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & ={(\\frac{∂(u,v)}{∂(x,y)})}^{-1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324125 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324126 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324127 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324128 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1000 #edb/ref 17592186324129 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1041 "selection" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1104 #edb/ref 17592186324128 13194139534975 true] [17592186324124 1110 #uuid "346a1dc7-6e51-5672-8084-22f514684aba" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324125 1034 "-5" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324125 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534975 true] [17592186324125 1111 #uuid "e8fc056f-3ac3-54ec-bc57-4220e1dc20f2" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324126 1034 "3" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324126 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534975 true] [17592186324126 1111 #uuid "19d6a6a6-23cc-569c-8631-f2e11b441797" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324127 1034 "-3" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324127 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534975 true] [17592186324127 1111 #uuid "a5d5a325-cc43-542a-8a42-5a21e54e484e" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324128 1034 "\\frac{1}{5}" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324128 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534975 true] [17592186324128 1111 #uuid "7cf4fc49-b901-5679-953b-d2c3801fe6b9" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324129 1034 "5" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324129 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534975 true] [17592186324129 1111 #uuid "8c69e388-b6fb-5e1d-8ef8-8a8c8738942b" 13194139534975 true] [17592186324130 1017 #edb/ref 1759218632413